  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Retro runner silhouette is part of the Bowerman Series\nBreathable mesh upper with synthetic metallic overlays\nAir Max heel units delivers a lightweight, springy underfoot feel and heritage energy\nCushlon foam cushioning also comes along for the ride for added comfort\nClassic lace closure secures the fit\nRubber outsole provides reliable traction across surfaces\nThe Nike Air Max Moto 2K is imported.\nReclaim your \"style lane\" when you lace up these Women's Nike Air Max Moto 2K Casual Shoes. A continuation of the Vomero series, the Moto 2K is crafted from an airy mesh upper with sheeny metallic synthetic overlays and equips Cushlon and visible Air Max heel units for a heritage-centric look with contemporary Swoosh charm.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max Moto 2K Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Metallic Silver/Smoke Grey</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3498111</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; borde